{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "396b4a8892dd5f1d735b7ef4f03e2a9b50e413867e04a1f72de836fe1ef1fe77", "ja": "まさか、「これからはお互い、一人暮らししよう」\n……とか！？　そ、それはちょっと……！", "zh": "该不会是，“今后我们各过各的，分开一个人住吧”\n……之类的！？那、那可有点……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "964095d7d1f21c348d943bf6280f98dd2d8cece86615f744ba134058baa4da66", "ja": "お姉ちゃんと一緒だと、毎日がとっても楽しいし。\n元気も出るし、それなのに家賃は半分で済むし……。", "zh": "和姐姐在一起，每天都特别开心，也能打起精神，而且房租还只要一半……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1002_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "62e98ea2ac9d526b219e632a6aac5a2fd96563517e136baaf02ea4fffcda418a", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。\nすみません、ちょっと確認したいことが……。", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n不好意思，我有件事想确认一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "0c72b69be4f520466d6e402049e5011176b14f87f4741318cd6550c51589bc17", "ja": "うう、もしそうなったらどうしよう……。\nいっそ、劇場に住ませてもらうとか……！？", "zh": "呜呜，要是真的变成那样，该怎么办啊……  \n干脆让我住在剧场里算了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7b16445b196bf65dcdb661cac5c38d3586e40dd4bff430986d789e996e5a3c3b", "ja": "……あの、青羽さん？", "zh": "……那个，青羽小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "a8d474040ac3ae4c624c57f33d39d7e238a37346c7788a31d437cc524161f04e", "ja": "はっ、{$P$}さん！？\nす、すみません。何かご用ですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！？\n对、对不起。请问有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "35018eb7e98f3b71b609db873a25fe8afd5fa51f61db02dd9366384aa4dc512e", "ja": "はい、衣装の状況を確認しておきたくて。\n年末に向けてイベントも多くなるので、念のため。", "zh": "嗯，我想确认一下服装的情况。\n临近年底活动也会变多，以防万一。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "01e74417ffe1c09fe660c636df8c92561d90099da990609c58cc4b772a1486fa", "ja": "年末に向けて……。\nあーっ！　思い出した！！", "zh": "到了年底……\n啊——！我想起来了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "5c47b2214a7d6b9af0c2bac207199b68f5e5e5524ba65a016712f0b471538287", "ja": "今年の年末は、お姉ちゃんと一緒に帰省するか、\nどこかで話をしないとって約束してて……！", "zh": "约好了今年年底要和姐姐一起回老家，或者找个地方聊一聊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "69fa6e0bf0737747dec15e6735e88784110104859dfbe306d3eb2a7658c339e9", "ja": "大事な話って、このことだ……！\nああ、よかったぁ♪", "zh": "重要的事，原来是指这个……！\n啊啊，太好了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "954f8ba94a2228c5bfb515256ed4c54dd879cf358503b21c235b9988582196e7", "ja": "……青羽さん？", "zh": "……青羽小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "7334efd9d38f8c7b7e1d21cd41c3efb14afeec2e275bb00208f57f6a3ce8b422", "ja": "ああっ！？　何度もすみません！\n衣装についてですよね！", "zh": "啊！？真是不好意思，打扰您好几次了！\n您是要问服装的事吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "213f37ff095bebb7bc9c297290d390fdcef4c1413dd9798f866017c968d00f92", "ja": "すべて、滞りなく進行中です！　あとでスケジュールに\n進捗を記入しておきますから、確認してもらえれば。", "zh": "一切都在顺利推进中！我之后会把进度记入日程表，您确认一下就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7ed950ff7cb17cab6712e6705586dae3e55dd883489b69c83b179428782615f4", "ja": "そうですか、よかったです。\nじゃあ自分は、事務所に行ってきますね！", "zh": "这样啊，那就好。\n那我先去事务所了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1015_102mis", "source_sha256": "0dae8f4689723841e014f1b87b0913606ec0fb142586bf7dfed26154fda9ffd2", "ja": "はい！　いってらっしゃ～い！\n……心配事もなくなったし、仕事に集中しなきゃ！", "zh": "好的！路上小心～！\n……担心的事也解决了，得集中精力工作才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1016_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "412eb6268ca9b693b140458943f3d3a4facb8da6bfbcd26d457c3732236da5eb", "ja": "劇場のアイドル39人で繋ぐ\n『STARDOM ROAD』公演も終盤戦……。", "zh": "由剧场的偶像39人串联起来的《STARDOM ROAD》公演也进入尾声……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "c5728530751baab583e8d1d6e5c2c3d6d0fd484262b8f3ce042ecd4f5732a1f2", "ja": "第七幕からは怒涛の展開が待ち受けている。\n準備の方はどうかね？", "zh": "从第七幕开始，将迎来一连串激烈的发展。准备得怎么样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "1dc41c16ffbf8fd2a530771158abb122d3bdd9a81cd244f920ec4ef9d748dde7", "ja": "はい、問題ありません！　今日の打ち合わせが\n終わり次第、メンバーに展開する予定です。", "zh": "是的，没问题！今天的讨论一结束，就准备向成员们传达。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "bc79ec668693aa28cbc66bdcd7915797eeee44a100784d664de9a1f35474cb0f", "ja": "なるちゃん、クロエちゃんにフォーカスを\n当てる流れから、次は遂に神宮寺さん……！", "zh": "从聚焦于なる和克洛伊的剧情发展来看，接下来终于要轮到神宫寺小姐了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "dc36189a6b43e64dfd8d97f1c134a490ad0618315b9aa643eadde9d69f2a81a5", "ja": "彼女にスポットを当てつつ、いよいよ\nお話の謎だった部分に、メスが入るんですね！", "zh": "在聚焦于她的同时，终于要对\n故事中成谜的部分动手术了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "0b4231a528e1b9e914ddfd87897982f8e342dfa6b6187641b91ce2dec4926d6f", "ja": "そうですね。物語の根幹に関わる部分が、\nこれからどんどん明らかになっていくと思います。", "zh": "是啊。与故事核心相关的部分，接下来应该会逐渐揭开真相。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "bc2b05bbf745347e724956fa2677587dc04ca272d4186e06001b2a9a5e7fa84e", "ja": "それ故の難しさもあるとは思いますが……\nでも、きっと大丈夫だと信じています。", "zh": "我想正因为如此，才会有其中的难处吧……\n不过，我相信一定没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "396a6c90733062703ada531d52992fdd2b078a87568155fe14741788aae8c4d5", "ja": "ここまで、劇場のみんなが積み重ねてきた事……\nお客さんは、ちゃんと見ていますから。", "zh": "一路走到现在，剧场的大家一点一滴积累下来的努力……\n客人们都看在眼里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1025_101kot", "source_sha256": "675eb9b9dcf66b609d6fcca25e02d780f449d4fa8dc85ebcb713fff5832986e4", "ja": "そうですね。なにより、みんなには\n{$P$}さんがいますから。", "zh": "是啊。最重要的是，大家还有{$P$}先生在嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "624586a5dcee1add4d7492fe9d92cffd2d809a7246c31f0c37aff2f5267c0614", "ja": "うむ！　だが劇場初のロングラン公演が好評のまま\n続けられているのは、君のおかげでもある……。", "zh": "嗯！不过，剧场首次的长期公演能够一直好评不断地持续下去，也有你的功劳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "6f2dba4850249072251c872da4092d884a8662200f1b943af8db8c0914a6727f", "ja": "このままアイドル諸君と共に、\n最終章を走り抜けてもらうよ！", "zh": "接下来，就和偶像们一起冲过最终篇章吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "8ccee1c7fa9b7ba64d431df85663090892f3f29adaf426c4bbdd335eac821bda", "ja": "もちろんです！　そのためにも早速、\n第七幕の打ち合わせを始めましょう！", "zh": "当然！为此，我们马上开始商量第七幕的安排吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
